-- The modal × join cells of a quantified obligation, on the BPMN exporter.
--
-- tenancy.l4 covers MUST under each join. The review of 2026-09-15 found that
-- the multi-instance marker, right for MUST, inverted two other cells — a
-- SHANT barrier drawn as breaching only when EVERY member had offended, and a
-- MAY barrier whose lapse timer manufactured the duty that follows a passed
-- resolution — and that no golden could have caught either, because none
-- exercised them. These rules are cut from ok/every/run-modals.l4 and the
-- review's own probes, with the traces left out; the ones that exercise the
-- runtime are there. One golden pair per rule, so a change to any cell moves
-- exactly one pair.

DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF
    Chair    HAS name IS A STRING
    Director HAS name IS A STRING

DECLARE Action IS ONE OF
    Approve HAS who IS AN Actor
    Sublet  HAS who IS AN Actor
    Publish HAS who IS AN Actor

theChair MEANS Chair OF "Ms Ng"
a MEANS Director OF "A"
b MEANS Director OF "B"
board MEANS LIST a, b

-- MAY × barrier, with a continuation: the corporate resolution (spec §2.2.1
-- Pattern B). If any director's permission lapses the resolution did not
-- pass and the chair owes nothing.
GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
`the resolution` MEANS
    EVERY Director d IN board MAY Approve (EXACTLY d) WITHIN 30
        ONCE ALL HAVE
        HENCE (PARTY theChair MUST Publish (EXACTLY theChair) WITHIN 5)

-- SHANT × barrier: one director subletting is the breach (R-Q5).
GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
`no subletting` MEANS
    EVERY Director d IN board SHANT Sublet (EXACTLY d) WITHIN 30
        ONCE ALL HAVE HENCE FULFILLED LEST BREACH

-- MAY × fork: each director who approves earns their own publication.
GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
`each approval is published` MEANS
    EVERY Director d IN board MAY Approve (EXACTLY d) WITHIN 30
        UPON EACH
        HENCE (PARTY theChair MUST Publish (EXACTLY theChair) WITHIN 5)

-- SHANT × fork: each director who sublets breaches on their own.
GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
`no subletting, severally` MEANS
    EVERY Director d IN board SHANT Sublet (EXACTLY d) WITHIN 30
        UPON EACH HENCE FULFILLED LEST BREACH BY d

-- MUST × barrier with a deadline in both positions (R-T2): the join's is
-- enforced on the whole, and is not drawn.
GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
`quorum by ten` MEANS
    EVERY Director d IN board MUST Approve (EXACTLY d) WITHIN 30
        ONCE ALL HAVE WITHIN 10 HENCE FULFILLED

-- MUST × fork with the deadline on the join line alone: it is each member's,
-- and it is the timer.
GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
`approve, or else` MEANS
    EVERY Director d IN board MUST Approve (EXACTLY d)
        UPON EACH WITHIN 10
        HENCE FULFILLED
        LEST  BREACH BY d
